WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.970
About 10 years ago...

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.410
...the Jupiter explorer Jupilos I brought back an energy substance...

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.300
Jupiter-X...

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.970
But this substance called Jupiter-X exploded and dissipated.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.710
And all of the exploratory ships launched after the explosions...

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.120
...were lost in outer space.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.760
HyoRyu and EnRyu, both of their bodies are intact.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.990
We should be thankful for that, at least.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:41.100
All of the unknown energy inside them has dissipated, after all.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:46.900
The force that catapulted HyoRyu and EnRyu into an ancient era...

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.110
...not only that, but an energy source so powerful it was able to...

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.980
...regenerate their bodies.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.210
Za Powa!

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.640
Jupiter, eh?

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.120
What could possibly be happening on that planet?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.240
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:07.140
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:14.110
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:18.760
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.990
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.080
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:33.780
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.740
It's time to launch!

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.920
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.840
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.500
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.420
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:58.170
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.680
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.350
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:12.880
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:18.880
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.700
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.880
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:29.940
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:33.080
Prologue to the End

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.840
<i>Prologue to the End</i>

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:54.200
See you tomorrow!

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.000
Oh, so the producer himself is taking on the editing, I see?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.900
It's the TV promo for this week's episode.

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.940
I need to get it done by tonight.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.450
You're really putting everything on the line for GaGaGatchi!

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.350
Is it true that last week the viewer ratings were over 30%?

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:11.290
That's right. My goal is to achieve 100% viewership!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.080
That would be amazing!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.490
Well, then, I'll be leaving now.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.000
100% viewership, huh?

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.760
It would be great to make it just once in my life.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.710
What's going on?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.710
Allow me to grant that wish of yours.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.640
Now then...

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:52.390
Let's see if you can take on GaGaGatchi's Fangs of Justice!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.360
As far as speed goes, I, King Snow, am far superior!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.270
Oh, please! Little children are so annoying.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.780
Is something the matter, Hana?

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:13.170
Huh? Oh! Uh, I'm gonna take the garbage out now!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.590
Hey, Hana!

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.890
It's too big of a load for you to be carrying two, isn't it?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.390
Let me come with you.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.970
Mamoru...

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.270
Slam dunk!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.570
Just kidding!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.710
Huh?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.610
What's the matter, Hana?

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.390
I...

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.550
I saw you, you know.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.560
The other day in outer space...

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.790
You had a set of wings...

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.800
...and you were all green...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.900
Are you really an alien?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.610
You're the son of Cain, and you were born on the Green Planet.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.200
Hana...

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.030
There's nothing like going to a hot spring in the winter!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:42.540
Right! And this place looks like it will be fun for Mamoru.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.970
But honey, will you be able to take time off from work?

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.840
Well, I can't always put my job first, you know.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.640
Children grow up so fast!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.380
We should treasure the time we have with him.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.850
You're right!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.640
I'm home!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.660
Zonder...

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.910
Zonder!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.250
Good morning...

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.320
As long as GaGaGatchi is around...

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.760
...evil shall never be allowed to flourish in this world!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.960
This anime show has been on all morning, you see.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.690
It's very, very interesting!

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:45.600
Is it?

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.500
Hold it, GaGaGatchi!

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.270
Are you King Snow?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:53.200
Oh, boy! I can't believe GaGaGatchi's on TV this time of day!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.110
Now's your chance! GaGaGatchi!

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.070
Use your GaGaCutter!

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.050
No, use your GaGaCollater!

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.940
Final GaGaGatchi!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.950
How come they're running the same show everywhere?

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:11.150
What happened to the SMW coverage, for heaven's sake?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.230
I wanna watch pro wrestling!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.290
Ayame...

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.540
There's no question about it.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:31.100
All terrestrial and satellite transmissions all over the world...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.440
...whether they're cable or wireless...

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.580
...they're all broadcasting this particular program!

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.920
It's a little offbeat for a Primeval plot.

00:07:37.320 --> 00:07:39.850
We still haven't heard from Mamoru.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.820
But I really don't think this is just a broadcasting glitch.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.120
Despite the fact that the enemy has launched its attack...

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:53.230
...Mamoru remains inexplicably unaware that anything is happening.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.930
Waha! It's a hot spring!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.570
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.610
Okay! Next we're gonna try that Kintaro Bath.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.440
Okay!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:07.280
I think I'll take a dip in the herbal bath instead.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.480
Let's go!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.350
Waha!

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:21.690
Are you really an alien?

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.200
I'm...

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:34.170
All preparations are complete.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.600
Opening the gate...

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:48.190
Begin the operation!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.510
So no one would notice that ES Window...

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.980
...they created a Zonder to scramble transmission signals.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:16.750
They may be able to fool Earthlings, but there's no deceiving our eyes.

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.050
Let's go, J!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:20.050
Right.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:23.320
J-Ark! Plunge into the ES Window!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.950
Roger.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.810
Ayame, please! Let's not do this...

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.110
Are you kidding me?

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.210
As a huge fan of pro wrestling...

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.840
...I've got to tell them how I feel no matter what!

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.050
Hey, you!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.120
Zonder!

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:06.230
Hana!

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.960
Ayame!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:12.840
Only one thing I can do now!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.050
Hello? Is this GGG?

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:30.040
GaGaGatchi

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.960
Coffee Bath

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.230
This coffee bath smells divine, don't you think?

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.230
I don't know, it smells kind of bitter!

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.800
I guess for you, we need to add some milk!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.300
I'm getting thirsty.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.740
I'm gonna get something to drink!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.910
Ul-tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base, Izanagi, separate and launch!

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.260
Izanagi has reached the atmosphere above Earth.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.650
Route to destination clear!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.820
GaiGar is in StealthGao-equipped mode. Now launching!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.990
Are you all right, EnRyu? RaiRyu?

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:36.490
Yeah...

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:37.890
More or less...

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.150
Really, what are we going to do with you?

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:41.820
Watch your backs! The enemy's nearby!

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.430
According to my information...

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.770
...there are a number of civilians trapped inside that building.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.670
Jamming signals?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:53.370
Is that it?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.500
Okay, then...

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.170
...take that!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:02.810
Zonder!

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:06.880
I've detected traces of Elementary Particle Z0, but not from a Primeval!

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.320
Then is it a Zonder?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.560
Did it transform itself?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.060
Zonder!

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.570
You're finally showing your face now, huh? You swine!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.500
Wait.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.140
But those are...

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.180
But that's so low!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.070
That Zonder robo...

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:32.010
...has been throwing off our sensors by introducing a unique...

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.570
...type of jamming signal into that TV show.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.750
So that was what was behind that anime show!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:42.010
Chief, we can't let that monster evolve any further.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.090
Otherwise, it'll spread Zonder spores all over the planet!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.230
Right.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.420
All machines, rescue the hostages without delay...

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.020
...and then annihilate the Zonder robo!

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.290
Symmetrical Docking!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.500
Symmetrical Docking!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:14.250
ChoRyuJin!

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:18.630
GekiRyuJin!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.900
Now! GekiRyuJin!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.540
Roar, Hurricane! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.880
Shuang Tou Long!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.180
Please, allow me!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:53.260
Yay! I'm gonna use Disc X to get rid of that thing once and for all!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:04.630
Those electromagnetic waves...

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:12.350
My eyes!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.440
My sensors aren't functioning!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.880
I'm so confused, I don't know what's happening!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.690
All systems malfunctioning. They cannot be launched!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:26.120
Damn! How long do I have to wait to get out there?

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.870
Just as I thought, there's a Zonder out there!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.540
Due to the powerful electromagnetic waves emitted by that Zonder Robot...

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.870
...all the networks are down!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.210
At this rate, it won't be possible to achieve Final Fusion!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:44.880
Damn! So I'm the only one who still has the ability to move?

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:13.440
I'm not done yet!

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:22.380
You mean you still have a hostage?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.690
Dad... Mom...

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.100
You have to go now, isn't that right?

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.140
I'm sorry.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.540
There's no need for you to be sorry!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:55.880
Because you're doing the right thing, Mamoru.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:01.220
You were born on the Green Planet, and you're the son of Cain.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:08.120
Mom and Dad... I'm not really your kid, am I?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.560
Mamoru...

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:14.670
My little Mamoru!

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:18.910
There's no question that you're our child!

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.100
That's right!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.080
It's just that the way you came to us was a little different than other kids!

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:26.940
Right...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.920
You don't have to worry about us. Go on, now!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.560
But...

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:36.830
Mamoru...

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.920
You see, everybody has something that's precious to them.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.030
I want you to become someone who can protect that precious thing.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:51.970
That's why I named you Mamoru. Your name means "protector".

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.840
Dad...

00:16:55.710 --> 00:16:56.610
What...

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:00.970
What's that?

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.510
I'm going now, then!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.260
Damn!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.130
Big Brother Gai!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:24.970
Mamoru!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.380
Big Brother Gai, leave him to me!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:44.990
Hana!

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:46.890
Mamoru!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.930
Are you really an alien?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.000
Hang on, Hana!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.560
The jamming's been cleared!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.210
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.000
Roger!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.810
Program Drive!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:09.780
Final Fusion!

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:36.140
I don't care if she tells me she hates aliens.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.780
I'm going to... I'm going to protect Hana!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.130
Hana, I want you to hold onto me really tight!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:57.060
Okay!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.670
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:08.780
I've been waiting on you!

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.610
Goldion Hammer!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.850
Activation approved!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.320
Roger!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:23.550
Goldion Hammer... Safety device... Relieve!

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.650
Hammer Connect!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.230
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.030
Hammer Hell!

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:12.110
Hammer Heaven!

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:22.780
Transform into light!

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.540
Hana...

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:41.470
Yes?

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:42.570
Watch closely, okay?

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.470
Curatio!

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.610
Teneritas!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.140
Sectio!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.680
Salus!

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.510
Coctura!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.750
As you can see, I'm an alien.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.560
I thought so...

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:11.930
Um, Mr. Alien, can you tell me where the real Mamoru is?

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:17.500
That's not what I meant. I'm the real Mamoru, see!

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:21.100
I've been real since the first day I met you...

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:22.740
Huh?

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.780
For real? Thank goodness!

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:32.780
I thought the real Mamoru got kidnapped by the aliens or something!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.690
Huh? Then...

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:35.950
Mamoru!

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:37.820
Thank you!

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:42.390
It was you who's been protecting us all this time, wasn't it?

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:45.290
Hana...

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.340
Now that the Zonder Robo's been destroyed...

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:57.070
...all networks have been restored.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.540
Well, thank goodness for that.

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:01.550
Gravity field fluctuations on the rise!

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:02.380
What?

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:05.010
250m in front of the Orbit Base!

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.410
It's an ES Window!

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.090
Is it a Primeval?

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:13.020
Prepare to attack!

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.290
It's not gonna happen...

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:16.090
We can't get the Protect Shade up in time!

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:18.000
The ES Window is about to open!

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:24.610
But that's...

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:48.220
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:49.920
The snow is falling on Christmas Day.

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:53.160
The battle that will determine the fate of the galaxy is about to begin.

00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:54.220
Let us go forth!

